WEBVTT

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.240
As long as you're getting your blood 
sucked, you don't care who it is, huh?

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:51.420
Shu-san... It hurts...

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:02.180
Of course. I'm making it hurt.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:05.270
Your face while I'm taking your blood...

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.320
It looks like you're begging for it.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.020
What a slut.

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:14.830
Let me go!

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.860
Why not admit it? You want this.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.760
If you say it, I'll suck as long as you want.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.870
Shu-san... Sto—

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:33.330
Quiet. Such insolent prey.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:46.060
You're prey of the finest quality.

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.160
I won't let them snatch you away.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.370
Besides...

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.280
It's such a pain to bring you back.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:14.100
Just stay here so I can take your blood.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:55.960
So, what do we do?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.380
Yeah...

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.000
If we never

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.170
get Eve back...

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:07.970
How should I know? Ruki won't say anything.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:15.370
But still, why did Ruki-kun

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:19.150
allow the masochistic kitten to escape that day?

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:31.040
I... wondered about that, too...

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:35.020
He seemed really anxious

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.500
when there was no sign of the awakening.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.800
There must be some reason behind it.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.050
Yeah...

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.550
I've never seen Ruki-kun

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.820
act like that before.

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:51.750
Yeah.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:56.100
Well, blabbering about it here 
won't get us anywhere.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.190
All we can do is ask Ruki.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.450
What the hell are they?!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:08.080
Wolves...

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.580
Whatever they are...

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.160
Aren't we kind of in trouble here?

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:37.690
The apple tree has withered.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.930
And it had such beautiful white flowers...

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:51.280
What?

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.170
What's happening?

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:36.330
What are you thinking about?

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.600
K-Kanato-kun.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.550
Wh-What's wrong?

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.300
Traitor.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.230
You belong to me, don't you? So...

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.600
Why did you go with them?!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.960
W-Well...

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:03.340
You're my toy, and only mine.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.860
I won't stand for this!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:30.280
You like it best when I suck your blood, right?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.500
That's how it should be.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:54.220
You should just remain by my side...

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:58.120
Remain right here.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.490
Just you and me...

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:16.850
Eve!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.640
There's trouble... It's Ruki!

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:22.260
Azusa-kun?

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:29.070
What's wrong? What happened?

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:40.840
Why are you trying to go to Azusa?

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.140
Ow! Kanato-kun, let me go.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.630
You still betray me.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.400
Then...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.260
I'll destroy both you and Azusa!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.790
No...

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:57.860
Eve!

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:00.040
Hurry.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.690
Shut up! Go home!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.590
Get out of here!

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.110
Stop.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.010
I see.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.350
If you won't be with me...

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.470
Then I can just kill you.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.520
Eve.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.490
Kanato-ku—

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:58.360
I won't let you interfere.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.230
Kanato-san... I'm sorry.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.880
Azusa!

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.650
Teddy! Teddy!

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.520
K-Kanato-kun!

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:35.660
Teddy! Teddy!

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:42.120
Let's go.

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.740
But...

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:25.390
I will drown all unsightly things in darkness.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:29.180
A world just for the two of us... You and me.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.740
That makes you happy too, right?

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:35.900
I won't allow you to betray me. Ever.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:40.410
I will drink to the last drop.
